","text":"嵇紹，字延祖，魏中散大夫康之子也。十歲而孤，事母孝謹。以父得罪，靖居私門。山濤領選，啟武帝曰：「《康誥》有言：『父子罪不相及。』嵇紹賢侔郤缺，宜加旌命，請為秘書郎。」帝謂濤曰：「如卿所言，乃堪為丞，何但郎也。」乃發詔徵之，起家為秘書丞。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"嵇紹","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"延祖","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"康","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"ocs_vxn_yn2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"山濤","kind":"person","person_id":"96a_987_925","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"嵇紹","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事／引語主語辨識，不以最近姓名機械延續。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jishao:p001:m0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"郤缺","kind":"person","person_id":"atj_f3h_1y6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本